note: we use G54 as coordinate system

1. Fedél
stock size: x>90mm y>280mm z~=21mm z<24mm (+ where you fix it)
1.0 Laser: cross.gcode
set x=0 y=0 relative to the part, z=top of the stock+ ~[3-5] mm
1.1 Laser: gravir-fixed.gcode
set the origo x=-10mm from the center of the cross, same height
1.2 Mill: box.gcode
use 3.175 endmill
use the cross for x-y calibration. move x-10mm, set z at bottom of the stock.
set origo there before running the job.
1.3 Mill: fedel-alja.gcode
use 3.175 endmill
turn the stock bottom-up (x'=-x,y'=y)
use the bottom-left screw hole for x-y calibration. move x-20mm,y-10mm, set z at bootom of the stock
set origi there before running the job

